  "question": {
    "text": "The circumcentre of a triangle lies at the origin and its centroid is the midpoint of the line segment joining the points <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>,&#160;-&#160;2</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8800;0</mo></math>.&nbsp;Then for any <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;the orthocentre of this triangle lies on the line"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": true
